cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Rewind: A Flight Recorder & Time-Travel Debugger for AI Agents"
abstract: >-
  Rewind is an open-source flight recorder and time-travel debugger for AI
  agents. It records every nondeterministic input (LLM sampling, tool I/O,
  wall-clock, RNG, external APIs) of an agent run into a single Boundary Log,
  then replays the run bit-exact and fully offline with zero API calls, enables
  time-travel scrubbing and counterfactual forks, auto-bisects passing versus
  failing runs to the first diverging decision, and clusters and root-causes
  failures across a fleet.
